    "body": "There's no such thing as a separate \"HTML4\" vs \"HTML5\". It's all HTML and is parsed and displayed in the same way.  (Plus `<!doctype html>` is over a decade old now; it's had plenty of time to accumulate its own compat even if we *were* treating it as something separate.)",
